  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Counterproliferation Program (ICP): National WMD Counterproliferation Strategy (Validation TTX)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CWMD National Strategy TTX was conducted with 38 articipants including representatives from the Romanian Intelligence Service (SRI), Foreign Intelligence Service (SIE), National Commission for Nuclear Activities Control (CNCAN), Ministry of Economy (ME), Romanian Border Police (IGPF), National Bank of Romania (BNR), Ministry for Foreign Affairs - Directorate for International Sanctions Implementation (MAE OISI), OSCE Directorate (DON), Department for Export Control (ANCEX), National Office for Prevention and Control of Money Laundering (ONPCSB), Ministry of National Defence (MAPN), Ministry for Internal Affairs - General Directorate for Operational Management (MAI DGMO), General Directorate for Internal Protection (DGPI), General Inspectorate of Romanian Police-Weapons, Explosives and Hazardous Substances Directorate (IGPR/DAESP), Romanian Customs Authority (AVR) - formerly General Directorate for Customs (DGV), General Directorate for Anti-Fraud (DGAF), and the General Directorate for Fiscal Inspection (DGIF). The event met its primary objective of evaluating the Romanian National CWMD Strategy to ensure the document is comprehensive and in alignment with real-world operations in the Romanian interagency.</narrative>
  </description>
